==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Le'boin]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 40~66.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~2,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 0.67~4 seconds<sup>20f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is a DPS check, so it's highly recommended to come in here having already acquired [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]]. Le'boin is the only annoying enemy here, and it has 64k hp on 1* making it a chore to grind down if you do not have the required dps, and even worse on the higher crowned difficulties. [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] is also a decent Single Attacker. You can also double dip and equip Bahamut Cat with [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] to really get in as much damage as possible.

